#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:81
msgid "The pressure reported by the tablet, between 0.0 and 1.0. If you use the mouse, it will be 0.5 when a button is pressed and 0.0 otherwise."
msgstr "De Andruck, den dat Tablett torüchmeldt. - En Weert twischen 0,0 un 1,0. Bi Muusbruuk is de Weert mit drückt Muusknoop 0,5 un anners 0,0."

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:82
msgid "How fast you currently move. This can change very quickly. Try 'print input values' from the 'help' menu to get a feeling for the range; negative values are rare but possible for very low speed."
msgstr "Dien aktuell Treckgauheit. De kann sik bannig gau ännern. Dat Rebeet lett sik över de Utgaav vun Ingaavweerten in't Hülp-Menü utkieken. Negativ Weerten warrt nich so faken bruukt, man sünd för bannig siete Gauheit ok mööglich."

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:83
msgid "Same as speed1, but changes slower. Also look at the 'speed2 filter' setting."
msgstr "Dat sülve as »Gauheit 1«, man mit langsamer Ännern. Kiek Di ok de Instellen för »Gauheitfilter 2« an."

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:84
msgid "Fast random noise, changing at each evaluation. Evenly distributed between 0 and 1."
msgstr "Gau tofällig Rusen, dat sik bi elk Utweerten ännert. Egaalweg verdeelt twischen 0 un 1."

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:85
msgid "This input slowly goes from zero to one while you draw a stroke. It can also be configured to jump back to zero periodically while you move. Look at the 'stroke duration' and 'stroke hold time' settings."
msgstr "Disse Ingaav ännert sik bi't Teken vun en Streek suutje vun 0 bet na 1. Een kann ok instellen, dat se bi't Teken in fastleggt Afstänn wedder op 0 torüchjumpt. Kiek Di de Instellen för Streekduer un Streek-Holltiet an."

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:86
msgid "The angle of the stroke, in degrees. The value will stay between 0.0 and 180.0, effectively ignoring turns of 180 degrees."
msgstr "De Streekwinkel, angeven in Graad. De Weert blifft twischen 0 un 180, d.h., dat Dreihen vun 180 Graad övergahn warrt."

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:87
msgid "This is a user defined input. Look at the 'custom input' setting for details."
msgstr "Dit is een vun den Bruker fastleggt Ingaav. Kiek Di de Instellen för »Egen Ingaav« a, wenn Du mehr Enkelheiten weten wullt."

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:152
msgid "opaque"
msgstr "Decken"

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:152
msgid ""
"0 means brush is transparent, 1 fully visible\n"
"(also known as alpha or opacity)"
msgstr ""
"»0« bedüüdt, de Pinsel is dörsichtig, un »1«, he is heel sichtbor\n"
"(ok as Alpha oder Deckstärk begäng)."

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:153
msgid "opaque multiply"
msgstr "Decken maalnehmen"

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:153
msgid "This gets multiplied with opaque. It is used for making opaque depend on pressure (or other inputs)."
msgstr "Dit warrt mit de Deckstärk maalnahmen. Warrt för druckafhangen Decken (oder anner Ingaven) bruukt."

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:154
msgid "opaque linearize"
msgstr "Decken lineariseren"

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:154
msgid ""
"Correct the nonlinearity introduced by blending multiple dabs on top of each other. This correction should get you a linear (\"natural\") pressure response when pressure is mapped to opaque_multiply, as it is usually done. 0.9 is good for standard strokes, set it smaller if your brush scatters a lot, or higher if you use dabs_per_second.\n"
"0.0 the opaque value above is for the individual dabs\n"
"1.0 the opaque value above is for the final brush stroke, assuming each pixel gets (dabs_per_radius*2) brushdabs on average during a stroke"
msgstr ""
"De Nich-Lineariteet richten, de bi't Överblennen vun mehr Plackens övereenanner rinkaamt. Dit Richten schall en lineaar »normaal« Druck torüchgeven, wenn den Druck »opaque_multiply« toornt is, wat de Normaalinstellen is. De Weert »0,9« lett sik goot för Standardstreken bruken. Maak dit lütter, wenn Dien Pinsel bannig streut, oder grötter, wenn Du »Plackens per Sekunn« bruukst.\n"
"0.0 - de Deckweert baven is för Dien egen Plackens\n"
"1.0 - de Deckweert baven is för den lesten Pinselstreek. Annahmen warrt, dat elk Pixel in'n Dörsnitt (dabs_per_radius*2) Pinselplackens per Streek kriggt."

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:155
msgid ""
"basic brush radius (logarithmic)\n"
" 0.7 means 2 pixels\n"
" 3.0 means 20 pixels"
msgstr ""
"Grundhalfmaat vun den Pinsel (logaritmisch)\n"
" 0.7 bedüüdt 2 Pixels\n"
" 3.0 bedüüdt 20 Pixels"

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:156
msgid "hardness"
msgstr "Scharpde"

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:156
msgid "hard brush-circle borders (setting to zero will draw nothing)"
msgstr "Scharp afsett Pinselkrinkgrenzen (Instellen »0« teekt Nix)"

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:157
msgid "dabs per basic radius"
msgstr "Plackens per Grundhalfmaat"

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:157
msgid "how many dabs to draw while the pointer moves a distance of one brush radius (more precise: the base value of the radius)"
msgstr "Woveel Plackens bi en Wieserbewegen vun den Afstand vun een Pinselhalfmaat teekt warrt (nauer: de Grundweert för dat Halfmaat)."

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:158
msgid "dabs per actual radius"
msgstr "Plackens per redig Halfmaat:"

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:158
msgid "same as above, but the radius actually drawn is used, which can change dynamically"
msgstr "Dat sülve as baven, man bruukt dat redig teekt Halfmaat, dat sik dünaamsch ännern kann."

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:159
msgid "dabs per second"
msgstr "Plackens per Sekunn"

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:159
msgid "dabs to draw each second, no matter how far the pointer moves"
msgstr "De Tall vun Plackens, de elk Sekunn teekt warrt, egaal wo wiet de Wieser treckt warrt."

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:160
msgid "radius by random"
msgstr "Tofällig Halfmaat"

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:160
msgid ""
"Alter the radius randomly each dab. You can also do this with the by_random input on the radius setting. If you do it here, there are two differences:\n"
"1) the opaque value will be corrected such that a big-radius dabs is more transparent\n"
"2) it will not change the actual radius seen by dabs_per_actual_radius"
msgstr ""
"Tofällig Halfmaatännern för elk Placken. Ok mit de Ingaav »by_random« bi de Halfmaatinstellen instellbor. Wenn dat hier instellt warrt, gifft dat twee Verschelen:\n"
"1.) De Weert för de Deckstärk warrt richt, so dat en groot Placken dörsichtiger is.\n"
"2.) Dat bi »dabs_per_actual_radius« sehn redig Halfmaat warrt nich ännert."

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:161
msgid "speed1 filter"
msgstr "Gauheitfilter 1"

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:161
msgid ""
"how slowly the input speed1 follows the real speed.\n"
"0.0 changes immediately as your speed changes (not recommended, but try it.)"
msgstr ""
"Wo siet de eerste Ingaavgauheit is, afhangen vun de redige Gauheit.\n"
"0,0 ännert direktemang, so as sik Dien Gauheit ännert (nich anraadt, man versöök dat maal)."

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:162
msgid "speed2 filter"
msgstr "Gauheitfilter 2"

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:162
msgid "same as 'speed1 slowness' but note that the range is different"
msgstr "Dat sülve as »Gauheitfilter 1«, man mit en anner Rebeet"

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:163
msgid "speed1 gamma"
msgstr "Gamma för Gauheit 1"

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:163
msgid ""
"This changes the reaction of the speed1 input to extreme physical speed. You will see the difference best if speed1 is mapped to the radius.\n"
"-8.0 very fast speed does not increase speed1 much more\n"
"+8.0 very fast speed increases speed1 a lot\n"
"For very slow speed the opposite happens."
msgstr ""
"Dit ännert de Reakschoon vun de Ingaav »Gauheit 1« hen to övermaten physikaalsch Gauheit. Dat fallt sünnerlich op, wenn »Gauheit 1« dat Halfmaat toornt is.\n"
"-8.0 - bannig gau, maakt »Gauheit 1« meist nich mehr grötter\n"
"+8.0 - bannig gau, maakt »Gauheit 1« bannig grötter\n"
"Bi bannig siete Gauheit is dat annersrüm."

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:164
msgid "speed2 gamma"
msgstr "Gamma för Gauheit 2"

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:164
msgid "same as 'speed1 gamma' for speed2"
msgstr "Dat sülve as »Gauheit 1«, man för »Gauheit 2«"

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:165
msgid "jitter"
msgstr "Jiddeln"

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:165
msgid ""
"add a random offset to the position where each dab is drawn\n"
" 0.0 disabled\n"
" 1.0 standard deviation is one basic radius away\n"
"<0.0 negative values produce no jitter"
msgstr ""
"Tofällig Versatz twischen de Plackenpositschonen tofögen.\n"
" 0.0 - ut\n"
" 1.0 - Standardverscheel is een Grundhalfmaat wiet weg\n"
